Odd or Even

Difficulty: Basic Accuracy: 60.6% Submissions: 135K+ Points: 1 Average Time: 5m

Given a positive integer n, determine whether it is odd or even. Return true if the number is even and false if the number is odd.

Problem Link :https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/odd-or-even3618/1?page=1&difficulty=Basic,Easy&status=solved&sortBy=submissions
*/




class Solution {
    static boolean isEven(int n) {
       if(n%2==0) 
       {
           return true;
       }
       else
       {
           return false;
       }
    }
}
/*
Note :
when given no div by 2 should return 0 in case of even else it is considered as odd which return false
